msgid "Permissions granted to all profiles."
msgstr "Luvat myönnetty kaikille profiileille."

msgid "Permissions removed from all profiles (except Super-Admin)."
msgstr "Luvat poistettu kaikista profiileista (paitsi Super-Admin)."
